    "created_at": "2026-07-23T09:20:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-23T09:20:32Z",
    "body": "> Might be reasonable to say that if the image is not rendered, we don't update the auto width?\n\nWe still want it to have an auto width initially though, no? Perhaps we say we don't update the auto width if it's not rendered and had its auto width updated at least once or some such?",
