    "created_at": "2026-09-28T11:03:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-28T11:03:51Z",
    "body": "I think that the spec should change so that if an image stops being rendered, the last rendered size is retained.\nThis would avoid the extra loads.\n\nDoes this sound right @emilio @zcorpan @austinh?\nWe have a [chromium CL](https://chromium-review.git.corp.google.com/c/chromium/src/+/8126943) that essentially does this but I wanted to make sure the spec captures this and that it's what we want to do before landing.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
